      "id": "claim_97bdb3d2e08044b0b426e852d87afb90",
      "statement": "Trusted Actions' Store abstraction dispatches on the DATABASE_URL scheme: postgres:// or postgresql:// selects PostgresStore (sqlx over pgx, intended for RDS/Aurora Postgres or local Postgres testing), while any other value including empty falls back to SQLiteStore (sqlx over modernc.org/sqlite, intended for local dev/test, defaulting to a local trusted_actions.db file and limited to a single pooled connection); both run dialect-specific migrations from internal/store/migrations/postgres and internal/store/migrations/sqlite on startup.",
